# Module 32: CKA Hands-On Labs

## Lab 1: Pod Creation

Create Pod:

```bash
kubectl run nginx \
--image=nginx
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

---

## Lab 2: Generate YAML Quickly

```bash
kubectl run nginx \
--image=nginx \
--dry-run=client \
-o yaml > pod.yaml
```

Edit.

Apply:

```bash
kubectl apply -f pod.yaml
```

---

## Lab 3: Deployment Scaling

Create:

```bash
kubectl create deployment web \
--image=nginx
```

Scale:

```bash
kubectl scale deployment web \
--replicas=5
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get deploy
```

